title: mf sync plan
tags: [[CLI command]] Sync
kind: reference
summary: Compute a sync plan into a freshly recreated plan repo, asking about conflicts no rule decides.

Reads both repositories — nothing in them is changed —, links what the intents file
selects ([[Matching records across repositories]]), compares every link that changed
([[Change detection in sync]]) and writes the operations into the plan repository,
recreated for the occasion ([[The sync plan]]). Prints its uuid and the number of
operations. `--on-conflict` decides every conflict at once ([[Sync conflicts]]);
`--host` picks the repository that keeps the plan and, when the pair has none yet,
its sync database ([[The sync database]]).
